         {
          "h_title": "Retractable Awnings Melbourne",
          "main_title": "Retractable Awnings Melbourne",
          "author": "Eurola Australia",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 1,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "If you are looking for amazing retractable awnings in Melbourne which will create additional relaxation space on your balcony, pergola or deck, then you have come to the right place. We have the best awnings to create a cool shade under the hot Melbourne sun and also protect you from rain.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Given the unpredictable Melbourne weather, we provide the best quality awnings which will last long and withstand sudden and instant weather changes.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Mon-Fri By Appointment Only",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Our Address",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Level 27/101 Collins St,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Melbourne VIC 3000,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Office Tel: +61 1300 08 99 88",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Open Hours",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Using only the finest quality European products that have been adapted to the Australasian climate, Eurola’s retractable pergolas, blinds and folding arm awnings are becoming iconic in Australian and New Zealand homes and businesses making us the leaders in weather smart retractable roof systems.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "table_content": null
         },
         {
          "h_title": "Retractable Roof Systems Melbourne",
          "main_title": "Retractable Awnings Melbourne",
          "author": "Eurola Australia",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 2,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Our retractable roof systems in Melbourne provide an attractive alternative to the permanent roof structure. This roofing system is suitable for both commercial and home purposes. The good thing about our awning is that it can be manually operated or motorised.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "The motorised ones are easy to operate because you just have to press a button to have them in the position you want. Also, you can fix them with optional sensors which will go a long way to relieving you of all the work of folding and unfolding. These sensors perform their job according to the weather changes. If the city is experiencing a scorching sun, it will extend the awning to create a shade and protect you from the direct sunlight.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
          "secondary_content": null,
          "table_content": null
         },
         {
          "h_title": "Retractable Pergolas",
          "main_title": "Retractable Awnings Melbourne",
          "author": "Eurola Australia",
          "language": "en",
          "level": 2,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "If you are looking to create a perfect entertainment or dining space in your outdoors (whether at home/office).",
